"speaker": "Louis",
"text": "Parmida! I was making a delivery and Sterling's goons jumped me."
}, {
"speaker": "Louis",
"text": "They took the bag - but not before I saw them run toward the loading yard."
}, {
"speaker": "Bentley",
"text": "*sniffs the air and growls*"
}, {
"speaker": "Louis",
"text": "Your dog smells something. Check behind the dumpster - I dropped a receipt there."
}])
